{"id":"n18264-1-9","stage":1,"title":"과일 · 水果","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18264-1-9-1","ko":"여름이 되니까 시원한 과일이 먹고 싶다.","zh":"一到夏天，就想吃些清爽的水果。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름이","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되니까","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원한","meaning":"爽口，清爽","explanation":"시원하다：爽口，清爽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과일이","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶다.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"爽口，清爽","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"食物冰凉爽快、正合胃口，或热乎得让人畅快淋漓。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e79bd1cf1bc1bd0b7c7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18264-1-9-2","ko":"여름 과일로는 수박이 최고지.","zh":"说到夏天的水果，西瓜绝对是最好的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과일로는","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수박이","meaning":"西瓜","explanation":"수박：西瓜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수박","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29555","senseId":"1","lemma":"수박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"최고지.","meaning":"最；最佳","explanation":"최고：最；最佳；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/a